---

# 📄 LLM-Powered Document Q&A System (RAG)

A simple **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)** system that lets you upload PDFs or DOCX files, generates embeddings, stores them in a vector database (FAISS/Chroma), and answers questions using **LangChain + OpenAI API**. Includes both a **FastAPI backend** and a **Streamlit dashboard** for easy interaction.

---

## ⚠️ Prerequisites

**This project requires an OpenAI API key to run.** Before getting started:

1. **Sign up for an OpenAI account** at [https://platform.openai.com/signup](https://platform.openai.com/signup)
2. **Create an API key** at [https://platform.openai.com/api-keys](https://platform.openai.com/api-keys)
3. **Ensure you have a billing plan** or trial credits available (the project uses these APIs: embeddings, GPT-3.5-turbo/GPT-4)

*For reviewers and recruiters: Please obtain your own OpenAI API key before running this project.*

---

## 🚀 Features
- Upload **PDF/DOCX** documents.
- Automatic text extraction and chunking.
- Embedding generation with **OpenAI embeddings**.
- Vector storage with **FAISS** (or Chroma).
- Question answering powered by **LangChain RetrievalQA + GPT-4**.
- REST API via **FastAPI**.
- Interactive dashboard via **Streamlit**.
- Persistent FAISS index (save/load from disk).

---

